                            <comment id="15031719" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 30 Nov 2015 12:41:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Leemoonsoo opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/491&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/491&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-475&quot; title=&quot;NullPointerException when run notebook previously generated before ZEPPELIN-387&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-475&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-475&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; NullPointerException when run notebook generated before &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-387&quot; title=&quot;allowing disabling of specific paragraphs&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-387&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-387&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    `p.getConfig().get(&quot;enabled&quot;)` can be null when Zeppelin load notebook generated before &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-387&quot; title=&quot;allowing disabling of specific paragraphs&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-387&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-387&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This PR fixes &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-475&quot; title=&quot;NullPointerException when run notebook previously generated before ZEPPELIN-387&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-475&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-475&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; by assuming &quot;true&quot; when `p.getConfig().get(&quot;enabled&quot;)` is null.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-475&quot; title=&quot;NullPointerException when run notebook previously generated before ZEPPELIN-387&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-475&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-475&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/491.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/491.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #491&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit e6a459f12b55f3bb52fc4748c4458fca8d485826&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Lee moon soo &amp;lt;moon@apache.org&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2015-11-30T12:37:15Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Assume &quot;enabled&quot; is true, when it is not defined.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
